  "text": "Skip to content\nABOUT\nCONTACT US\nFLIP IT\nOur\nWe typed an entire brilliant paragraph while looking at the keyboard.\nWe looked up, and it was in the wrong language.\nSo we built this app to save our computers from being thrown out the window.\nTry it now\nAbout Language Flipper\n\nLanguage Flipper gives bilingual professionals the exact tool they need to stop wasting time retyping text and instantly fix frustrating keyboard layout mistakes.\n\nOur lightweight desktop application works seamlessly exactly where you work. Whether you are drafting emails in Outlook, managing clients in Salesforce, chatting in Slack, writing code in VS Code, or browsing in Chrome, etc., our hotkey rescues your mistyped text.\n\nLanguage Flipper actively prevents the ultimate momentum killer: the backspace key.\n\nThat simple mechanism was implemented directly into your operating system, giving you the ability to keep your creative flow completely uninterrupted all day.\n\nBeing bilingual typists who suffered through years of accidental gibberish, it has become our passion in life to make everyday typing entirely frustration-free.\n\nDownload Now\nMac DMG\n\nDownload now and get 40 free flips\n\nWindows EXE\n\nDownload now and get 40 free flips\n\nGet Premium\n\nEnjoy unlimited flips and extra featurs\n\nTalk to us\nlets get in touch\nFacebook\n \nX-twitter\n \nYoutube\n \nLinkedin\nAbout\nAbout us\nhome\nContact\nLets talk\nFlip it\nMade with ♡ by Language flipper\nAccessibility Statement\nTerms Of Service\nPrivacy Policy",
